   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FRS301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.2</span>\n<h2>Grading: every mark and its weight</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Read this in week one — part of the grade is earned in class long before any exam.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 11193 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">FRS301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.2</span>\n<h2>Cách tính điểm: đủ mọi đầu điểm và trọng số</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đọc ngay tuần đầu — một phần điểm được tính trong lớp từ rất sớm, trước mọi kỳ thi.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 11193 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Category<br><small>Đầu điểm</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Parts<br><small>Số phần</small></th><th>Weight<br><small>Trọng số</small></th><th>Completion criteria<br><small>Điều kiện hoàn thành</small></th><th>Duration<br><small>Thời lượng</small></th><th>CLO</th><th>Question type<br><small>Dạng câu hỏi</small></th><th>No. of questions<br><small>Số câu</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Lab-Projects</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>14</td><td><strong>40.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60-90'/each</td><td></td><td>practical exercises</td><td>N/A</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Midterm Progress Test</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>20.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td>30'-40'</td><td></td><td>Multiple choices Marked by Computer or a suitable format</td><td>20-25</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Participation in Discussions</strong></td><td>on-going</td><td>1</td><td><strong>10.0%</strong></td><td>&gt;0</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>N/A</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>Final Exam</strong></td><td>Final exam</td><td>1</td><td><strong>30.0%</strong></td><td>4</td><td>60'</td><td>LO1, LO2, LO3, LO4, LO5, LO6, LO7, LO8, LO9, LO10</td><td>Multiple choices</td><td>40-50</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>The weights add up to <strong>100%</strong>. Minimum average to pass: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>How to read \"Completion criteria\":</em> it is the minimum score that one mark must reach (e.g. <code>&gt;0</code> = you must not get zero / must sit it; <code>4</code> = at least 4/10). Missing it can mean failing the subject even with a good average — this reading is the website's explanation, the table itself is the university's.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tổng trọng số đúng <strong>100%</strong>. Điểm trung bình tối thiểu để qua môn: <strong>5</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\"><em>Cách đọc cột \"Điều kiện hoàn thành\":</em> là điểm tối thiểu đầu điểm đó phải đạt (vd <code>&gt;0</code> = không được 0 / phải dự; <code>4</code> = tối thiểu 4/10). Không đạt có thể trượt môn dù điểm trung bình cao — phần giải thích này là của web, bảng là của trường.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>The fine print per mark (verbatim)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lab-Projects</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> technical aspect of studied topics<br><em>Grading guide:</em> Guided by instructor<br><br>- 14 Lab-Projects are arranged relevant to the chapter theory<br><br>- Student must finish labs and submit the results to the lecturer in class.<br><br>- An average point of all labs could be evaluated and published to students at the end of the semester.</li>\n<li><strong>Midterm Progress Test</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> cover Lectures 1-9<br><em>Grading guide:</em> in class, by instructor<br><em>Note:</em> Instruction and schedules for Progress Tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus. The test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material. Instructor has responsibility to review the test for students after graded.</li>\n<li><strong>Final Exam</strong> — <em>Knowledge & skill:</em> concepts, algorithms; all studied Chapters<br><em>Grading guide:</em> by exam board, using computer<br><em>Note:</em> The exam questions must be updated or different at least 70% to the previous ones.</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Chi tiết từng đầu điểm (nguyên văn)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lab-Projects</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> technical aspect of studied topics<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> Guided by instructor<br><br>- 14 Lab-Projects are arranged relevant to the chapter theory<br><br>- Student must finish labs and submit the results to the lecturer in class.<br><br>- An average point of all labs could be evaluated and published to students at the end of the semester.</li>\n<li><strong>Midterm Progress Test</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> cover Lectures 1-9<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> in class, by instructor<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> Instruction and schedules for Progress Tests must be presented in the Course Implementation Plan approved by director of the campus. The test must be taken right after the last lectures of required material. Instructor has responsibility to review the test for students after graded.</li>\n<li><strong>Final Exam</strong> — <em>Kiến thức & kỹ năng:</em> concepts, algorithms; all studied Chapters<br><em>Hướng dẫn chấm:</em> by exam board, using computer<br><em>Ghi chú:</em> The exam questions must be updated or different at least 70% to the previous ones.</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11193\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11193</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11193\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=11193</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
